Tags:           wayland systemtray systray taskbar iconbar panel bar
Comments:       ----------
                usage example:
                $ mkdir -p ~/.config/sfwbar
                $ cp /usr/local/share/sfwbar/t2.config ~/.config/sfwbar/sfwbar.config
                customize ~/.config/sfwbar/sfwbar.config if desired
                $ sfwbar &
                ----------
                note: sfwbar works with any compositor that supports layer shell protocol (e.g., labwc)
